# Publish only after GitHub

Before packaging or publishing this app to the production server:

1. Commit the reviewed changes.
2. `git push` to GitHub (`origin`).
3. Only then run `./deploy/publish.sh`.

Do not publish uncommitted work, unpushed local commits, or use `--allow-dirty`. The publish script must reject those cases. If publish is blocked because HEAD is not on GitHub, push first, then publish.
